      "writtenOn": "2024-06-10T15:30:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nice find! And thanks for the fix.\n\nI think it would be slightly nicer to specify `display:block` within the element itself, see here for an example: https://cs.opensource.google/gerrit/gerrit/gerrit/+/master:polygerrit-ui/app/elements/settings/gr-registration-dialog/gr-registration-dialog.ts;l\u003d76;drc\u003daa1c08b7c7ddad8bad696b70c09ed566cd1c8a59\n\n`display:block` should actually be the default for 99% of all webcomponents. If it missing, then this was probably just forgotten ...",
      "revId": "64b80e501a1698ee982d984a79cd74f6cc6f5453",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
