      "writtenOn": "2024-06-11T09:47:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I did consider adding the style directly on `\u003cgr-diff-element\u003e` but that looked like a lot of boiler plate.  I eventually found the shared style and that makes the fix a one line patch which is conveniently placed next to the `position: relative` which is also for positionning `\u003cgr-selection-action-box\u003e`.",
      "parentUuid": "1491a1cb_04d429da",
      "revId": "64b80e501a1698ee982d984a79cd74f6cc6f5453",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
